OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers will
OL,6,Fcontinue across northern and western
OL,7,Fparts through the evening and night.
OL,8,FBecoming mainly dry across the east
OL,9,Fwith clear periods. Light westerly
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FVariable amounts of cloud
OL,13,Fwith some sunny spells and a few
OL,14,Fshowers, these mainly across the west
OL,15,Fand north. Becoming largely dry with
OL,16,Fincreasing sunny spells in the
OL,17,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
