OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMainly
OL,6,Fdry and bright on Sunday, perhaps a
OL,7,Ffew showers in the north. Becoming
OL,8,Funsettled on Monday and Tuesday with
OL,9,Frain, although the west may be drier.
